    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Change Your Audience\r\n\r\nThis chatbot will help you change you writing for a different audience.\r\n\r\n1. Choose one the purposes for using AI that you identified.\r\n\r\n2. Test this chatbot to see how well it helps with that purpose.\r\n\r\n   **Prompt example:** Change this sentence so that a 5 year old could understand: There are many phases of matter like solid, liquid, and gas.\r\n\r\n3. Judge what AI did well and what it did not do well.\r\n",
